[News] 次の7月から9月までの四半期は、マイナス成長になるという予想も出ています。

65
00:09:01,759 --> 00:09:05,792
[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

66
00:09:06,392 --> 00:09:15,847
[Slow] 4月から6月までの実質GDPは、年率で何パーセント増えましたか。

67
00:09:16,648 --> 00:09:21,591
[Host] One point one percent at an annual rate — below market expectations.

68
00:09:22,192 --> 00:09:27,927
[Slow] プラス成長は、何四半期連続ですか。

69
00:09:28,727 --> 00:09:30,648
[Host] Three quarters in a row.

70
00:09:31,248 --> 00:09:42,024
[Slow] 経済を支えたのは、国内の需要ですか。それとも、海外の需要ですか。

71
00:09:42,823 --> 00:09:47,816
[Host] Overseas demand, such as exports. Domestic demand was weak.

72
00:09:48,416 --> 00:10:02,072
[Host] That's all for today. Japan's economy is still growing on paper, but with consumption and investment this weak, economists are watching the next quarter closely. See you next time on Japanese Daily News.

73
00:10:02,672 --> 00:10:05,072
[News] また明日。
